  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Use exactly four choices, and make only one the real spelling of the target word.",
      "Every wrong choice is a misspelling of that same word, not a different word that also fits the clue.",
      "Tier 1 wrong spellings change the vowel or drop a chunk so they look clearly wrong.",
      "Tier 2 wrong spellings drop the silent e, write el instead of le, or miss a vowel letter.",
      "Tier 3 wrong spellings stay one or two letters off: double a consonant that should be single, or leave a short vowel with only one consonant.",
      "A common misspelling may be a distractor, but it is never the correct choice.",
      "Choices are whole words. Do not use isolated sounds, IPA, or held sound clips.",
      "Do not describe a picture in the stem. For a concrete noun, set media to one lemma.",
      "Stay with school, home, food, pets, play, family, and weather. No brand names and no real child names."
    ]
  },
